WEBVTT

00:01.630 --> 00:02.967
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.991 --> 00:04.326
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.350 --> 00:07.566
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.590 --> 00:13.150
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.150 --> 01:31.110
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.270 --> 01:34.510
=Episode 24=

01:36.160 --> 01:37.410
You're Xu Longxiang?

01:38.110 --> 01:39.110
Yeah.

01:40.885 --> 01:41.890
What a coincidence!

01:42.810 --> 01:43.946
I knew you're in Mount Longhu,

01:43.970 --> 01:45.930
but I didn't expect
to see you right after I came.

01:50.260 --> 01:52.435
It's destiny, I guess.

01:55.285 --> 01:56.290
You want to fight?

01:57.585 --> 01:59.985
People say the second son
of the Xu family has a pure heart.

02:00.260 --> 02:01.650
It turns out to be true.

02:07.485 --> 02:08.490
Sir,

02:08.835 --> 02:10.660
what are you going
to do with my disciple?

02:16.435 --> 02:17.935
Zhao Xituan, a Longhu Arch-Taoist.

02:18.835 --> 02:20.060
Who are you?

02:20.335 --> 02:21.495
It's just a misunderstanding.

02:21.960 --> 02:24.085
I came to Mount Longhu to find someone.

02:24.435 --> 02:25.490
Sorry to bother you.

02:25.985 --> 02:27.290
Goodbye.

02:28.735 --> 02:29.735
Hey.

02:31.160 --> 02:32.850
Did I let you leave?

02:33.810 --> 02:34.985
Old Taoist,

02:35.010 --> 02:36.090
do we fight him?

02:43.930 --> 02:45.130
The Three-thousand Red Thread?

02:46.435 --> 02:48.435
What's the relationship
between you and Han Diaosi?

02:49.160 --> 02:51.050
I came to find someone under orders.

02:51.135 --> 02:53.170
Please let me off.

02:54.035 --> 02:56.026
You wanted to fight?

02:56.050 --> 02:57.130
Just a misunderstanding.

02:58.985 --> 03:00.435
Say sorry to my disciple.

03:03.935 --> 03:05.250
I was confused just now.

03:05.385 --> 03:07.410
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

03:09.160 --> 03:10.250
No fight?

03:14.285 --> 03:16.010
He's my successor.

03:16.485 --> 03:18.210
Do you think making a bow is enough?

03:20.160 --> 03:22.090
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

03:24.460 --> 03:25.460
No fight? Whatever.

03:33.235 --> 03:34.235
How about

03:34.385 --> 03:35.385
I kowtow to you?

03:36.410 --> 03:37.610
What's your name?

03:37.760 --> 03:39.810
My name is insignificant.

03:45.535 --> 03:46.535
Go.

03:46.985 --> 03:48.170
Thank you, sir.

03:48.310 --> 03:49.730
Thank you, Your Highness.

03:58.110 --> 04:00.060
He's flexible.

04:00.210 --> 04:02.510
Another rising star
from the new generation.

04:02.810 --> 04:04.010
Don't be afraid, Old Taoist.

04:04.285 --> 04:05.410
If he bullies you,

04:05.685 --> 04:06.685
I'll help you beat him.

04:07.035 --> 04:08.706
Stop calling me Old Taoist.

04:08.730 --> 04:10.130
You need to call me Master.

04:10.335 --> 04:11.435
Old Taoist Master.

04:12.885 --> 04:14.435
Fine, fine, fine. That'll do.

04:18.170 --> 04:19.346
(Mansion of Liu) Such a tragedy.

04:19.370 --> 04:20.370
(Mansion of Liu) Yeah.

04:21.490 --> 04:22.490
Honey.

04:28.260 --> 04:29.260
Honey?

04:31.635 --> 04:32.635
My lady.

04:44.335 --> 04:45.147
Mr. Liu

04:45.171 --> 04:46.826
was dragged away by a horse
quite a while ago.

04:46.850 --> 04:48.626
The leader called himself
the Son of the Lord of North Liang,

04:48.650 --> 04:49.650
Xu Fengnian.

04:53.610 --> 04:54.610
Look.

04:54.985 --> 04:56.066
That's Lord Liu.

04:56.090 --> 04:57.130
Lord Liu Liting.

04:57.410 --> 04:59.610
Who's dragging him?

05:01.235 --> 05:03.235
(Yangcheng)

05:25.060 --> 05:25.812
Your Highness,

05:25.836 --> 05:26.890
watch out.

05:36.193 --> 05:38.885
(Mansion of Lu)

06:15.660 --> 06:16.660
You

06:17.410 --> 06:18.530
made trouble again?

06:25.060 --> 06:26.310
You look emaciated.

06:36.335 --> 06:37.335
Sister,

06:39.760 --> 06:41.560
let's go home, okay?

06:51.785 --> 06:52.785
Fengnian!

06:53.885 --> 06:54.885
Fengnian!

06:58.560 --> 06:59.560
Fengnian!

07:08.560 --> 07:10.985
(Capital of Liyang Official Posthouse)

07:18.960 --> 07:21.035
You seem relaxed, Grand Commander.

07:25.310 --> 07:26.490
Han Diaosi.

07:27.785 --> 07:28.786
What brings

07:28.810 --> 07:30.685
you here, Cruel Cat?

07:32.210 --> 07:33.850
I was away from the capital city.

07:33.985 --> 07:35.266
Please pardon me, Grand Commander.

07:35.290 --> 07:35.930
Look,

07:36.185 --> 07:38.810
I come to greet you
right after I get back.

07:39.310 --> 07:42.490
The head of the eunuchs
comes to greet me?

07:43.185 --> 07:44.410
That's too much for me.

07:52.110 --> 07:53.686
Grand Commander, things

07:53.710 --> 07:55.385
aren't looking good for you.

07:55.585 --> 07:56.585
What?

07:57.130 --> 07:58.130
In your opinion,

07:58.610 --> 08:00.010
I'm going to lose?

08:01.235 --> 08:02.490
I'm afraid you will.

08:04.285 --> 08:05.585
In the last few years,

08:05.760 --> 08:08.185
he hasn't lost a single game.

08:14.485 --> 08:16.250
Is there still hope for this?

08:17.185 --> 08:18.185
He

08:18.735 --> 08:20.610
Only keeps playing
if he's going to win.

08:20.885 --> 08:22.450
If he's about to lose,

08:22.610 --> 08:24.610
he'll wipe away all the pieces.

08:26.935 --> 08:29.690
You're quite cheeky as a player.

08:31.060 --> 08:32.535
Not only as a player.

08:34.835 --> 08:36.355
How to play a game,
how to act in life.

08:42.910 --> 08:43.827
Your son

08:43.851 --> 08:46.110
inherited the essence of you.

08:50.310 --> 08:51.760
Has my baby boy

08:52.785 --> 08:54.330
made another mistake?

09:00.330 --> 09:01.490
Secret reports from Jiangnan.

09:01.735 --> 09:03.610
Please have a look, Grand Commander.

09:04.060 --> 09:04.946
Since they are secret reports,

09:04.970 --> 09:05.970
I won't read them, then.

09:08.410 --> 09:09.660
It isn't a small thing.

09:10.685 --> 09:13.250
I suggest you read them,
Grand Commander.

09:22.985 --> 09:24.650
I'm old,

09:25.535 --> 09:26.546
and I'm dim-sighted now.

09:26.570 --> 09:27.985
Tell me about them.

09:28.785 --> 09:30.335
In Jiangxin County, His Highness

09:30.410 --> 09:33.466
broke into the house
of a Jiangnan gentleman Liu Liting.

09:33.490 --> 09:36.185
He tied Liu Liting up to a horse

09:36.285 --> 09:37.147
and dragged him to Yangcheng,

09:37.171 --> 09:38.730
so that Liu was killed.

09:38.890 --> 09:41.426
All scholars are shocked by this.

09:41.450 --> 09:44.011
Jiangnan scholars wrote
a joint memorial to the throne.

09:44.035 --> 09:46.075
The memorial is on its way
to the capital city.

09:47.760 --> 09:49.385
Since he killed the man,

09:50.385 --> 09:51.761
punish him in accordance with the law.

09:51.785 --> 09:53.010
Why are you telling me this?

10:01.985 --> 10:03.450
The second report.

10:03.560 --> 10:05.235
Upon his arrival at Yangcheng,

10:05.385 --> 10:06.770
His Highness was assassinated.

10:12.160 --> 10:13.266
Grand Commander,

10:13.290 --> 10:15.650
don't you ask if he's dead or not?

10:16.510 --> 10:18.186
If he was dead,

10:18.210 --> 10:20.435
you'd come
along with the imperial troops.

10:23.535 --> 10:26.435
What are you suggesting,
Grand Commander?

10:30.060 --> 10:31.060
You look at him.

10:31.910 --> 10:33.435
Those eunuchs

10:33.560 --> 10:35.285
like to beat around the bush.

10:35.535 --> 10:37.910
They like to mince words

10:38.160 --> 10:39.410
instead of talking frankly.

10:39.885 --> 10:40.666
I mean

10:40.690 --> 10:41.690
I can't put up with them.

10:41.985 --> 10:44.690
Don't get me involved in your bicker.

10:46.085 --> 10:47.146
It wasn't me.

10:47.170 --> 10:48.170
He's the one who cut in.

10:52.735 --> 10:53.910
You cheat again.

10:55.860 --> 10:59.711
The investigation shows
His Highness was stabbed in the back

10:59.735 --> 11:00.895
and spilled blood on site.

11:06.060 --> 11:07.310
Your turn. Hurry.

11:10.535 --> 11:13.626
Luckily, his cavalrymen
came to his rescue in time.

11:13.650 --> 11:15.610
Favored by God, His Highness

11:15.910 --> 11:17.250
stayed alive.

11:17.310 --> 11:20.370
As we speak, he's recovering
in the Mansion of Lu.

11:21.810 --> 11:22.810
Well.

11:35.060 --> 11:36.360
Be careful.

11:37.010 --> 11:38.010
How is it?

11:38.560 --> 11:40.410
His wound is healing fast.

11:40.485 --> 11:42.110
It's just a flesh wound.

11:42.885 --> 11:45.411
If it was one inch to the left,

11:45.435 --> 11:46.650
he would be dead by now.

11:46.985 --> 11:47.985
He is a lucky dog!

11:51.460 --> 11:52.460
Sister,

11:52.935 --> 11:54.135
don't worry.

11:54.460 --> 11:55.911
The vermin lives long.

11:55.935 --> 11:57.610
I won't die so easily.

11:58.535 --> 11:59.910
You are just in denial.

12:00.250 --> 12:01.561
Since you knew there would be assassins,

12:01.585 --> 12:03.066
why didn't you take precautions?

12:03.090 --> 12:05.160
I was eager to avenge you.

12:06.085 --> 12:07.410
You killed Liu Liting.

12:08.785 --> 12:10.510
He deserved it
because he tried to harm you.

12:11.335 --> 12:12.107
Do you know that

12:12.131 --> 12:14.011
his wife wanted
to report you to the government?

12:17.585 --> 12:19.785
(Yangcheng Governmental Office)

12:28.035 --> 12:29.026
It's a murder in public.

12:29.050 --> 12:31.130
But the law enforcement
doesn't do anything about it.

12:37.485 --> 12:38.925
The government didn't take the case?

12:39.035 --> 12:40.826
Their announcement said the officers

12:40.850 --> 12:41.850
got a cold.

12:42.110 --> 12:44.085
Are they scared of my identity?

12:45.685 --> 12:48.810
This is Jiangnan. Why are they
scared of the son of North Liang?

12:50.210 --> 12:52.346
You made such a big mistake.

12:52.370 --> 12:54.785
The Lu Family should have
kicked you out of here.

12:55.235 --> 12:57.385
They didn't want
to get involved in your trouble.

12:58.185 --> 12:59.625
Then why did they change their mind?

13:00.560 --> 13:03.160
Well,
fortune and misfortune come together.

13:03.485 --> 13:06.490
You got injured at the right time.

13:11.450 --> 13:12.985
His Highness's injury

13:13.385 --> 13:15.866
stirred the Lu Family.

13:15.890 --> 13:18.370
Liu Liting was dead,

13:19.160 --> 13:19.930
and the Lu Family

13:20.085 --> 13:21.961
wanted to stay out of it,

13:21.985 --> 13:23.010
leaving His Highness

13:23.110 --> 13:26.660
to those indignant Jiangnan scholars.

13:27.360 --> 13:29.235
But it happened

13:30.060 --> 13:31.810
that he got assassinated.

13:37.210 --> 13:38.660
They are scared of North Liang.

13:39.970 --> 13:40.970
Yes.

13:41.185 --> 13:43.035
No matter how big the trouble was,

13:43.435 --> 13:46.635
the Lu Family would scold him.

13:47.110 --> 13:48.985
After all, you are relatives.

13:49.735 --> 13:51.285
But the assassination

13:51.410 --> 13:52.785
made things more complicated.

13:53.485 --> 13:55.936
The Lu Family now
has to shelter His Highness.

13:55.960 --> 13:57.386
They can't make you feel

13:57.410 --> 13:59.310
it was them who did it.

14:01.210 --> 14:02.450
We're relatives.

14:02.735 --> 14:04.490
No need for the scrupulousness.

14:07.360 --> 14:08.360
Relatives?

14:09.060 --> 14:11.130
Lu Daolin is the Minister of Rites,

14:11.435 --> 14:12.890
and he's right in the capital city.

14:13.530 --> 14:15.226
You've been here for days.

14:15.250 --> 14:16.985
Did he ever come to visit you?

14:17.460 --> 14:18.760
Everybody is busy.

14:19.610 --> 14:20.960
It can't be forced.

14:28.285 --> 14:30.510
It's only the three of us here.

14:31.910 --> 14:33.910
Let's put the cards on the table.

14:34.560 --> 14:35.640
It is true that North Liang

14:36.210 --> 14:38.066
and the Lu Family
are bound together via a marriage.

14:38.090 --> 14:41.410
But North Liang isn't the only side
that they depend on.

14:41.560 --> 14:42.785
In my opinion,

14:42.960 --> 14:44.585
when His Highness arrives in Yangcheng,

14:44.710 --> 14:46.785
they are supposed to be hard on him

14:47.135 --> 14:48.860
to appease His Majesty.

14:49.435 --> 14:51.335
But because of the assassination,

14:51.560 --> 14:53.290
they have to offer shelter
to His Highness.

14:54.110 --> 14:55.460
It's both good

14:56.035 --> 14:57.610
and bad.

15:02.810 --> 15:03.946
The benefit

15:03.970 --> 15:05.210
is that

15:05.410 --> 15:07.850
the Lu Family will
take good care of you.

15:08.085 --> 15:10.460
They don't dare to watch you die.

15:11.460 --> 15:13.706
Our father doesn't get his title Slayer

15:13.730 --> 15:15.250
for nothing.

15:15.885 --> 15:17.245
The government didn't hear my case

15:17.785 --> 15:19.290
under the order of the Lu Family?

15:19.735 --> 15:22.266
Notable families and great clans
in Jiangnan

15:22.290 --> 15:24.170
are like the noble family.

15:24.360 --> 15:24.947
Since there's a benefit,

15:24.971 --> 15:26.531
there also has to be a downside, right?

15:28.460 --> 15:29.227
The downside

15:29.251 --> 15:30.435
is that

15:30.730 --> 15:32.930
the Lu Family is too close
to North Liang.

15:33.360 --> 15:34.810
The capital city

15:35.385 --> 15:36.810
won't be happy about it.

15:39.210 --> 15:41.226
I took Er'qiao home from the street.

15:41.250 --> 15:42.570
She isn't a Lu.

15:43.210 --> 15:45.185
There aren't many good Lu people.

15:45.585 --> 15:47.435
If it wasn't for your injury,

15:47.685 --> 15:50.490
they wouldn't even send
coals to our room.

15:50.710 --> 15:51.811
They're so harsh on you?

15:51.835 --> 15:52.546
Yeah…

15:52.570 --> 15:53.570
Keep dressing the wound.

15:53.635 --> 15:54.635
Stop nonsense.

15:58.210 --> 15:59.610
Don't listen to her.

15:59.860 --> 16:01.535
I have a pretty good life here.

16:03.135 --> 16:04.450
Let's get back to business.

16:04.985 --> 16:06.585
Father is trying

16:06.710 --> 16:09.250
to keep your hereditary peerage
in the capital city.

16:10.160 --> 16:12.186
But if there is no conflict

16:12.210 --> 16:14.050
between Jiangnan and North Liang,

16:14.535 --> 16:16.666
why will His Majesty make you

16:16.690 --> 16:17.850
the Lord of North Liang?

16:22.035 --> 16:23.085
Grand Commander,

16:23.335 --> 16:25.186
you should know

16:25.210 --> 16:26.610
what His Majesty would like to see.

16:27.885 --> 16:30.135
How am I supposed to know

16:31.135 --> 16:32.535
what His Majesty would like to see?

16:34.135 --> 16:36.036
The murder that Xu Fengnian committed
in Jiangnan

16:36.060 --> 16:38.085
was pure atrocity.

16:39.685 --> 16:41.460
But His Majesty enjoys it.

16:41.785 --> 16:43.261
The more trouble he makes,

16:43.285 --> 16:45.311
the more Jiangnan scholars hate him.

16:45.335 --> 16:47.135
In the meantime,
the happier His Majesty gets.

16:47.685 --> 16:49.085
You speak the truth

16:49.685 --> 16:51.710
quite generously.

16:54.510 --> 16:56.135
But now His Highness got injured.

16:56.385 --> 16:58.510
The Lu Family has to take care of him.

16:59.835 --> 17:01.735
The situation is not good.

17:05.410 --> 17:06.410
Hey,

17:07.110 --> 17:08.110
how about this?

17:09.060 --> 17:11.690
We ask His Majesty
to give an imperial order.

17:11.985 --> 17:12.985
Uh…

17:13.260 --> 17:14.260
What…

17:14.610 --> 17:16.010
What order?

17:16.370 --> 17:17.370
He orders

17:17.660 --> 17:20.850
Xu Fengnian to kill some Lu people.

17:21.210 --> 17:22.210
By then,

17:22.235 --> 17:25.036
I'm certain they'll fall out with us.

17:25.060 --> 17:27.706
And then everybody's happy, right?

17:27.730 --> 17:29.885
Please don't be absurd, Grand Commander.

17:30.260 --> 17:32.435
It's impossible that His Majesty
gives such an order.

17:37.035 --> 17:38.485
What else can I do, then?

17:41.535 --> 17:43.710
I order Fengnian

17:44.160 --> 17:46.085
to kill our relatives?

17:50.385 --> 17:52.735
The only way Xu Fengnian
gets to inherit the peerage

17:53.035 --> 17:55.130
is to make sure North Liang is isolated.

17:55.360 --> 17:56.370
How to make that happen,

17:57.035 --> 17:59.060
you think about it, Grand Commander.

18:11.135 --> 18:12.375
I can't play this game anymore.

18:13.310 --> 18:14.310
Let's start over.

18:16.985 --> 18:18.210
That's all for me.

18:21.010 --> 18:22.010
Farewell.

18:27.735 --> 18:28.735
Hey.

18:30.685 --> 18:32.035
Fengnian

18:32.860 --> 18:34.810
was assassinated
by Fujiang Armors.

18:35.460 --> 18:36.666
The last generation of Fujiang Armors

18:36.690 --> 18:38.410
were slain by him.

18:39.285 --> 18:41.360
Do you think there's a connection

18:42.135 --> 18:44.890
between the assassination
and Han Diaosi?

18:46.385 --> 18:49.850
This game alone is already
nerve-racking enough.

18:50.135 --> 18:52.460
Why would you make it
more difficult for a monk?

18:57.210 --> 18:58.210
Fine.

18:59.285 --> 19:00.635
However, Grand Commander,

19:01.335 --> 19:03.730
Han Diaosi was right.

19:04.050 --> 19:06.410
If the Lu Family doesn't fall out with
North Liang,

19:06.850 --> 19:10.330
you don't get
to keep the hereditary peerage.

19:11.810 --> 19:15.085
Didn't you make a backup plan?

19:19.535 --> 19:21.060
Come on, come on.

19:21.310 --> 19:22.310
Let's play the game.

19:22.930 --> 19:24.450
Things will work out for the boy.

19:25.110 --> 19:27.570
He'll be relying on his luck this time.

19:28.110 --> 19:30.290
In my opinion,
you'd better get yourself healed first.

19:30.760 --> 19:32.460
When you're feeling better,

19:32.850 --> 19:34.226
you find an excuse

19:34.250 --> 19:35.570
to make a scene in the Lu Family.

19:35.885 --> 19:37.160
In that way,

19:37.535 --> 19:39.435
things will be easier.

19:39.860 --> 19:41.346
Xu Xiao had me come to Jiangnan

19:41.370 --> 19:43.210
to fall out with the Lu Family.

19:45.410 --> 19:47.250
But I'm not going to follow his plan.

19:47.610 --> 19:48.610
Why?

19:49.835 --> 19:51.275
Because you're in the Mansion of Lu.

19:53.635 --> 19:55.536
Xu Xiao had schemed for long

19:55.560 --> 19:56.680
both publicly and furtively.

19:56.785 --> 19:58.810
He took everything into consideration

20:00.010 --> 20:02.170
except for you.

20:03.335 --> 20:04.335
Don't say nonsense.

20:04.735 --> 20:06.415
It'll be easy for me
to fall out with them.

20:06.685 --> 20:07.935
They won't kill me,

20:08.235 --> 20:09.711
and I can leave directly.

20:09.735 --> 20:10.735
But what about you?

20:11.135 --> 20:12.386
You'll keep living here,

20:12.410 --> 20:13.570
and what will they do to you?

20:15.010 --> 20:16.510
They're nice to me.

20:16.610 --> 20:17.835
How nice?

20:18.235 --> 20:20.810
Other than His Lordship,
no one is nice to you.

20:21.435 --> 20:22.910
You go get a basin of hot water.

20:23.260 --> 20:24.260
Okay.

20:29.385 --> 20:30.961
Don't listen to her nonsense.

20:30.985 --> 20:32.386
Take the crazy thoughts
out of your head.

20:32.410 --> 20:34.730
I'm their daughter-in-law.

20:34.935 --> 20:37.490
How badly can they treat me?

20:38.410 --> 20:40.210
You just do your thing.

20:40.560 --> 20:42.610
Once you keep your peerage,

20:43.185 --> 20:45.970
you can take over
North Liang fair and square.

20:47.360 --> 20:49.066
Think about the greater good.

20:49.090 --> 20:51.170
So, I have to put you in misery
for the greater good?

20:51.785 --> 20:53.490
I'd rather give it up!

20:57.235 --> 20:58.785
I can fall out with the Lu Family,

20:59.385 --> 21:00.690
but on one condition.

21:01.810 --> 21:02.810
Sister,

21:04.485 --> 21:05.485
leave here with me.

21:07.110 --> 21:08.410
Silly boy.

21:09.660 --> 21:11.340
It's fine that you go to
Wudi City with me.

21:11.560 --> 21:14.080
It's also fine that I have someone
send you back to North Liang.

21:14.135 --> 21:15.135
Or

21:15.660 --> 21:17.340
I'll have someone send you
to Mount Wudang.

21:23.760 --> 21:25.035
I won't go anywhere.

21:26.530 --> 21:27.530
Sister,

21:28.185 --> 21:29.946
don't you think about yourself?

21:29.970 --> 21:30.970
All right.

21:31.360 --> 21:32.810
I know that you care about me.

21:33.810 --> 21:35.186
You get yourself healed first.

21:35.210 --> 21:36.466
When you're in good shape,

21:36.490 --> 21:37.685
we talk about it.

21:39.385 --> 21:40.410
Rest well.

21:40.510 --> 21:41.530
I'll leave you alone.

21:52.860 --> 21:53.530
My lady.

21:53.635 --> 21:54.635
Shush.

22:02.510 --> 22:03.506
After Young Master comes here,

22:03.530 --> 22:04.770
the Lu Family becomes nicer.

22:04.960 --> 22:06.146
The monthly allowance

22:06.170 --> 22:07.546
will be sent here later.

22:07.570 --> 22:08.960
Way faster than before.

22:16.210 --> 22:17.210
Sit.

22:21.960 --> 22:23.370
What's your order, my lady?

22:23.860 --> 22:25.086
Get a carriage for me.

22:25.110 --> 22:26.335
But don't let them find out.

22:26.810 --> 22:28.290
Where are you going?

22:29.385 --> 22:30.570
To pay respects to the dead.

22:31.460 --> 22:32.700
You're going to the Liu Family?

22:32.890 --> 22:33.707
Keep it down.

22:33.731 --> 22:35.135
You can't go, my lady.

22:35.235 --> 22:36.111
If you do,

22:36.135 --> 22:37.090
everybody will think

22:37.130 --> 22:38.850
that you and Liu Liting had an affair.

22:40.360 --> 22:41.170
It's okay.

22:41.335 --> 22:42.410
Just do as I say.

22:43.860 --> 22:44.587
My lady,

22:44.611 --> 22:46.535
don't be so hard on yourself.

22:46.935 --> 22:48.810
What Fengnian doesn't
have the heart to do

22:49.185 --> 22:50.810
will only be done by me.

22:52.010 --> 22:53.010
Go.

23:01.135 --> 23:02.375
Where did you get the carriage?

23:02.410 --> 23:03.410
Carriage rental.

23:03.660 --> 23:04.860
I did it behind the Lus' back.

23:05.385 --> 23:06.385
Okay.

23:07.610 --> 23:08.467
You go back in the house.

23:08.491 --> 23:10.011
I'm going to the Liu Family on my own.

23:10.135 --> 23:11.285
I'll go with you.

23:12.260 --> 23:13.050
No.

23:13.185 --> 23:14.710
Fengnian is a clever kid.

23:14.835 --> 23:16.355
He'll ask around if he doesn't see me.

23:17.760 --> 23:19.435
If he asks you,

23:19.810 --> 23:21.506
you tell him
that I went out to get him a doctor.

23:21.530 --> 23:22.690
Don't arouse his suspicion.

23:23.090 --> 23:24.335
My lady…

23:25.685 --> 23:26.860
Don't worry.

23:28.610 --> 23:29.561
How about this?

23:29.585 --> 23:32.130
You leave Jiangnan with Fengnian later

23:32.635 --> 23:34.210
to stay away from this miserable life.

23:34.235 --> 23:35.570
I must stay by your side.

23:37.210 --> 23:38.450
Such a silly girl.

23:40.060 --> 23:41.060
Go back in.

23:41.910 --> 23:43.886
Jiangxin County.
The Mansion of Liu Liting.

23:43.910 --> 23:44.910
Yes.

23:55.690 --> 23:57.050
Xu Fengnian is injured.

23:58.885 --> 23:59.885
He isn't dead.

24:01.635 --> 24:02.770
Listen to me.

24:03.185 --> 24:05.010
I thought about it over and over again,

24:05.060 --> 24:07.466
and I feel like
it's Xu Xiao's ill intent

24:07.490 --> 24:08.930
that he asked us to travel together.

24:10.685 --> 24:13.090
If it's indeed his scheme,

24:14.060 --> 24:15.610
we'll have to depend on Xu Fengnian.

24:15.910 --> 24:17.010
Him?

24:17.535 --> 24:18.910
Just for precaution.

24:19.610 --> 24:21.210
Let's go visit an injured man.

24:21.260 --> 24:22.260
It isn't troublesome.

24:23.760 --> 24:24.427
Come on.

24:24.451 --> 24:26.210
Let's go. Go.

24:34.560 --> 24:36.770
I heard you were assassinated.

24:36.935 --> 24:38.490
Luckily, they failed.

24:38.860 --> 24:41.185
I wonder if we are needed?

24:47.635 --> 24:48.635
Your Highness?

24:49.460 --> 24:50.710
I'm afraid he's asleep.

24:51.710 --> 24:52.710
Hey.

25:06.735 --> 25:08.130
I thought he was injured.

25:08.710 --> 25:09.710
Where is he?

25:10.110 --> 25:11.260
How am I supposed to know?

25:12.035 --> 25:13.186
Is Er'qiao here?

25:13.210 --> 25:15.130
Your monthly allowance is…

25:17.885 --> 25:19.636
We're here to see His Highness.

25:19.660 --> 25:22.490
Could you please tell us
where His Highness went?

25:22.530 --> 25:23.811
I don't serve the rooms here.

25:23.835 --> 25:25.130
How am I supposed to know?

25:26.560 --> 25:28.160
We'll keep asking around, then.

25:50.910 --> 25:52.330
Hail, Prime Minister.

25:54.310 --> 25:56.960
What was Xu Xiao's reaction?

25:57.935 --> 25:59.210
We talked much,

25:59.835 --> 26:01.035
but he said nothing useful.

26:02.635 --> 26:04.585
When hearing about
the assassination on his son,

26:04.910 --> 26:06.435
he didn't have any reaction, either?

26:08.935 --> 26:10.335
His expression didn't change a bit.

26:16.810 --> 26:18.130
Slayer?

26:19.385 --> 26:21.085
I say he's a weasel.

26:22.910 --> 26:24.935
Xu Xiao has made many efforts

26:25.960 --> 26:27.810
to keep the hereditary peerage,

26:29.285 --> 26:31.530
so, he won't call it quits.

26:32.410 --> 26:33.410
In my opinion,

26:34.290 --> 26:36.985
the Xu Family will certainly
fall out with the Lu Family.

26:37.235 --> 26:38.586
By then, I'm afraid His Majesty

26:38.610 --> 26:42.410
will have to allow
their hereditary peerage to remain.

26:43.485 --> 26:45.610
North Liang
mustn't belong to Xu anymore.

26:51.310 --> 26:52.585
The assassination

26:53.635 --> 26:55.210
failed, too?

26:55.685 --> 26:56.810
Li Chungang

26:57.835 --> 26:59.370
is at Xu Fengnian's side.

27:01.585 --> 27:03.130
Then

27:04.135 --> 27:05.690
we can't take his life?

27:08.360 --> 27:10.530
Our man has set off to Mount Longhu.

27:11.935 --> 27:14.010
The one hiding in Mount Longhu

27:14.735 --> 27:17.010
should be able to challenge Li Chungang.

27:22.710 --> 27:24.290
The Fisherman by Bottomless Pool, huh?

27:25.235 --> 27:27.610
How come I don't know about this Pool?

27:31.210 --> 27:32.330
It isn't easy

27:32.435 --> 27:33.475
to kill my brother-in-law.

27:39.285 --> 27:40.785
There's a hidden master

27:41.710 --> 27:43.185
in Mount Longhu?

27:43.910 --> 27:45.485
Please don't bother about it,

27:46.110 --> 27:47.690
Prime Minister.

27:49.170 --> 27:50.170
In a word,

27:50.660 --> 27:52.250
please trust us, Prime Minister.

27:52.760 --> 27:55.770
I'll make sure Xu Fengnian
won't return to North Liang alive.

27:57.960 --> 28:00.090
You know that His Majesty

28:00.760 --> 28:02.690
doesn't want Xu Fengnian dead.

28:03.360 --> 28:04.610
Why are you aiding me?

28:05.810 --> 28:09.460
The strategy of appeasement only leads to
endless trouble afterwards.

28:14.035 --> 28:15.250
That's true.

28:17.060 --> 28:18.306
Once Xu Fengnian is killed,

28:18.330 --> 28:19.610
North Liang will rebel for sure.

28:20.435 --> 28:23.050
Yet a clean cut is necessary.

28:24.135 --> 28:25.250
The momentary chaos

28:25.570 --> 28:27.260
is better than the lengthy chaos.

28:29.910 --> 28:31.060
As long as I'm around,

28:31.910 --> 28:34.090
the tumult will certainly be sorted out.

28:37.660 --> 28:40.890
You are the backbone of the nation.

28:41.185 --> 28:43.930
But I don't believe

28:44.560 --> 28:46.250
that you're doing this for the nation.

28:48.260 --> 28:50.410
I don't care

28:50.450 --> 28:51.810
why you want Xu Fengnian dead,

28:52.685 --> 28:55.725
but here's a warning.

28:56.810 --> 28:58.890
If it's harmful for the nation,

28:59.910 --> 29:01.810
I won't let you off.

29:06.085 --> 29:08.260
If you're going to kill Xu Fengnian,

29:10.435 --> 29:13.060
make it quick.

29:16.785 --> 29:18.185
Prime Minister, please

29:18.685 --> 29:20.135
wait for the good news.

29:38.035 --> 29:40.460
(Mount Longhu Bottomless Pool)

30:01.060 --> 30:02.760
There really is a fisherman.

30:07.035 --> 30:08.035
Try him.

30:25.260 --> 30:27.286
It's impossible
that we reach Jiangxin County so fast.

30:27.310 --> 30:28.655
Why do we stop?

31:09.985 --> 31:10.985
Fengnian.

31:23.410 --> 31:24.710
Seriously?

31:30.435 --> 31:31.786
I asked Ning Emei's soldiers

31:31.810 --> 31:33.170
to guard the front and back doors.

31:33.710 --> 31:34.910
The moment Er'qiao went out,

31:35.085 --> 31:36.085
I knew.

31:38.135 --> 31:39.426
Your wound hasn't healed.

31:39.450 --> 31:40.770
You shouldn't go out on your own.

31:41.460 --> 31:42.530
If I didn't,

31:43.585 --> 31:44.985
who would talk you into going back?

31:49.260 --> 31:51.300
The Lu Family isn't
the only big family in Jiangnan.

31:52.210 --> 31:53.385
When I'm recovered,

31:53.810 --> 31:56.130
I'll make enemies with the entire
Jiangnan literary circle.

31:56.185 --> 31:57.186
I'll mess up with more families.

31:57.210 --> 31:59.050
By then,
the capital city will also be pleased.

32:00.735 --> 32:01.735
Sister.

32:02.085 --> 32:03.410
You know well my ability

32:03.860 --> 32:04.970
to make trouble, don't you?

32:09.010 --> 32:10.135
Of course, I do.

32:11.535 --> 32:12.535
So, you promise me

32:13.660 --> 32:15.140
that you stop being hard on yourself?

32:20.385 --> 32:22.060
If I chase after you every day,

32:23.235 --> 32:24.610
my wound will never be healed.

32:31.660 --> 32:32.850
Okay, I promise.

32:33.685 --> 32:35.285
You don't need
to worry about me anymore.

32:37.860 --> 32:39.010
That's decided, then.

32:39.985 --> 32:41.050
Give me some time.

32:42.010 --> 32:43.010
When my wound is healed,

32:43.535 --> 32:45.310
I'll make a scene.

32:53.835 --> 32:55.110
Is he dead?

32:56.460 --> 32:57.490
He's asleep.

32:59.560 --> 33:01.185
How did you do it?

33:03.110 --> 33:05.270
You were given the authority
to command Fujiang Armors.

33:05.810 --> 33:06.960
What's the relationship

33:07.285 --> 33:08.460
between you and Han Diaosi?

33:10.710 --> 33:11.810
He's my master.

33:17.735 --> 33:20.135
You're the illegitimate prince?

33:20.960 --> 33:22.370
You know me?

33:23.260 --> 33:24.410
I also know

33:24.685 --> 33:26.610
that you come to Mount Longhu

33:27.085 --> 33:28.970
to ask me to kill Xu Fengnian.

33:31.535 --> 33:32.960
Are you a deity or what?

33:34.185 --> 33:35.690
Why do you want him dead?

33:39.310 --> 33:40.411
Remove the evil from the nation.

33:40.435 --> 33:41.435
No.

33:41.635 --> 33:43.635
You wish to cause chaos
across the world.

33:43.910 --> 33:44.910
During the chaos,

33:45.385 --> 33:47.305
you'll take your opportunity
to steal the throne.

34:00.110 --> 34:01.110
This is…

34:08.660 --> 34:10.090
The Imperial Seal.

34:32.560 --> 34:38.272
(Fengtian Hall)

34:41.250 --> 34:44.370
Bow.

34:52.090 --> 34:55.210
Arise.

34:57.770 --> 35:01.530
- Praise your greatness. Long live the emperor.
- Praise your greatness. Long live the emperor.

35:02.650 --> 35:06.410
- Praise your greatness. Long live the emperor.
- Praise your greatness. Long live the emperor.

35:07.450 --> 35:11.210
- Praise your greatness. Long live the emperor.
- Praise your greatness. Long live the emperor.

35:51.660 --> 35:52.660
It fell.

35:54.385 --> 35:57.450
No!

36:00.785 --> 36:01.785
No.

36:10.985 --> 36:11.985
What…

36:12.960 --> 36:14.060
What's the matter with me?

36:16.360 --> 36:17.650
Was that a hallucination?

36:17.910 --> 36:19.235
All officials bow down to you.

36:19.485 --> 36:20.765
The sovereignty is in your hand.

36:21.435 --> 36:22.685
That was a sweet dream.

36:24.010 --> 36:25.760
You can enter my heart?

36:26.635 --> 36:28.235
You really are a deity?

36:29.285 --> 36:31.310
Human force has a limit,

36:31.885 --> 36:33.535
yet the changes of thoughts

36:33.935 --> 36:35.560
are limitless.

36:37.985 --> 36:39.310
Beautiful mountains,

36:39.635 --> 36:40.686
spring rain and winter thunder,

36:40.710 --> 36:41.746
into your eyes, into your ears,

36:41.770 --> 36:43.135
and eventually into your heart.

36:44.210 --> 36:45.335
All emotions,

36:45.560 --> 36:46.885
all the hate and love,

36:47.535 --> 36:49.130
stem from the heart.

36:50.710 --> 36:53.530
Human heart is the master of the body,

36:53.835 --> 36:55.260
the realm for everything.

36:58.910 --> 37:00.310
My power

37:01.285 --> 37:03.610
is about heart and mind.

37:04.210 --> 37:07.586
I perturbed your mind with the seal

37:07.610 --> 37:09.285
and led you into the dream.

37:09.760 --> 37:11.860
What you saw in the dream

37:12.385 --> 37:13.890
is what you eagerly crave

37:14.860 --> 37:16.810
deep in your heart.

37:18.085 --> 37:19.370
A dream?

37:22.260 --> 37:23.561
The Imperial Seal…

37:23.585 --> 37:24.585
A fake one.

37:24.710 --> 37:27.010
Maybe only the seal

37:27.435 --> 37:29.610
can break into your heart.

37:30.860 --> 37:32.210
Because what your heart

37:32.260 --> 37:33.595
craves the most

37:34.185 --> 37:36.050
is the throne.

37:43.485 --> 37:44.785
It is godlike power,

37:46.335 --> 37:48.285
isn't it?

37:49.935 --> 37:51.285
It's not that easy.

37:53.060 --> 37:54.960
First, I need to know about your past,

37:55.335 --> 37:56.570
guess your thoughts,

37:57.335 --> 37:59.385
and then find a good chance

38:00.010 --> 38:02.290
to perturb your mind

38:03.235 --> 38:05.090
before I lead you into the dream.

38:05.710 --> 38:06.710
You

38:07.260 --> 38:08.460
know me?

38:09.585 --> 38:11.185
I knew about you long ago.

38:12.785 --> 38:14.085
I heard from my Master

38:15.160 --> 38:16.760
that you also come
from the royal family.

38:17.985 --> 38:19.330
I won't leave the mountain.

38:23.285 --> 38:24.930
North Liang has a large army.

38:25.760 --> 38:28.010
They will be Liyang's major concern.

38:28.735 --> 38:29.930
Only by killing Xu Fengnian

38:30.490 --> 38:31.810
can the lurking danger be erased.

38:32.185 --> 38:33.450
Without getting any fish,

38:34.110 --> 38:35.410
I won't leave the mountain.

38:36.585 --> 38:37.585
Fish?

38:38.885 --> 38:39.885
What fish do you want?

38:40.110 --> 38:41.660
I-I'll help you.

38:42.335 --> 38:43.335
Okay.

38:43.410 --> 38:44.810
Try it first.

38:46.335 --> 38:47.910
Pull the fishing rod out.

38:51.135 --> 38:52.135
Huh?

38:55.760 --> 38:57.130
How deep is the pool?

38:58.035 --> 38:59.510
Didn't Han Diaosi say

38:59.985 --> 39:01.310
it's a bottomless pool?

39:02.160 --> 39:03.290
Bottomless?

39:03.885 --> 39:05.445
Then what have you been trying to fish?

39:07.535 --> 39:09.090
A thousand-year salamander.

39:13.485 --> 39:15.160
Does it even exist?

39:45.435 --> 39:46.426
You said you need
to guess one's thoughts

39:46.450 --> 39:47.427
and perturb one's mind

39:47.451 --> 39:48.561
before leading one into a dream.

39:48.585 --> 39:50.185
How come you knocked him out so easily?

39:51.710 --> 39:52.736
When Han Diaosi

39:52.760 --> 39:54.930
put them into the armor,

39:55.110 --> 39:57.085
they lost their minds.

39:57.460 --> 39:58.460
So, it's easy naturally.

40:04.410 --> 40:06.311
How long have you been trying
to fish the salamander?

40:06.335 --> 40:07.810
More than twenty years.

40:08.310 --> 40:09.660
Still haven't got it?

40:17.235 --> 40:18.385
By seniority,

40:18.810 --> 40:20.310
how do I address you?

40:20.435 --> 40:21.650
No seniority with me.

40:21.835 --> 40:23.185
Just call me by my name.

40:23.660 --> 40:24.660
Zhao Huangchao.

40:26.485 --> 40:27.636
I wouldn't dare.

40:27.660 --> 40:29.760
(Zhao Huangchao,
Recluse of Mount Longhu)

40:32.385 --> 40:33.460
I'll call you sir.

40:33.885 --> 40:35.710
I need to show respect for you.

40:42.985 --> 40:44.660
No game today?

40:47.610 --> 40:49.185
We played games for days,

40:50.260 --> 40:51.910
and I've been waiting for you to speak.

40:53.485 --> 40:55.035
Since you don't want to tell me,

40:56.460 --> 40:57.985
I'll just ask.

41:03.510 --> 41:04.760
Over these years,

41:05.410 --> 41:07.466
I've been asking you to investigate

41:07.490 --> 41:09.035
who got involved in the assassination

41:09.460 --> 41:10.586
on my wife

41:10.610 --> 41:12.635
in the capital city

41:13.185 --> 41:14.265
more than twenty years ago.

41:18.460 --> 41:20.536
It's really difficult to investigate.

41:20.560 --> 41:21.560
It is.

41:21.735 --> 41:23.386
But every time we met,

41:23.410 --> 41:25.235
the first thing you told me was,

41:25.385 --> 41:26.850
no progress.

41:28.660 --> 41:29.826
You came to the capital city this time

41:29.850 --> 41:31.035
and we met…

41:31.860 --> 41:32.860
Yang Taisui,

41:36.010 --> 41:37.510
you said nothing

41:38.160 --> 41:39.330
about it.

41:40.135 --> 41:41.735
You purposefully avoided bringing it up.

41:43.060 --> 41:44.185
What have you got?

41:46.585 --> 41:47.770
I don't have

41:47.835 --> 41:49.285
a full list.

41:50.110 --> 41:51.110
But

41:51.410 --> 41:53.035
there was one piece of information.

41:54.910 --> 41:57.485
When your wife was assassinated,

41:57.735 --> 41:59.710
someone was in the capital city.

42:00.635 --> 42:01.635
Who?

42:01.935 --> 42:03.410
He was in the capital city,

42:03.610 --> 42:05.536
but he didn't necessarily do anything.

42:05.560 --> 42:06.412
Tell me his name

42:06.436 --> 42:07.660
and I'll investigate.

42:09.110 --> 42:10.510
I kept the name from you

42:10.860 --> 42:13.260
for so long

42:13.710 --> 42:16.010
because I'm afraid
it'll cause you trouble.

42:18.560 --> 42:19.685
Will I be scared?

42:20.460 --> 42:21.460
Speak.

42:24.335 --> 42:25.335
Sir,

42:25.510 --> 42:27.436
you've been fishing here
for more than twenty years.

42:27.460 --> 42:29.286
You can occasionally go out
and come back to continue fishing.

42:29.310 --> 42:30.750
It doesn't make a difference, right?

42:31.635 --> 42:33.610
I fought someone twenty years ago.

42:33.860 --> 42:35.235
My power backfired on me.

42:35.685 --> 42:36.685
Right now,

42:37.060 --> 42:39.385
the Bottomless Pool stabilizes my mind.

42:40.135 --> 42:41.560
Without the salamander,

42:42.060 --> 42:43.160
I will never

42:43.785 --> 42:45.335
leave the mountain.

42:47.890 --> 42:49.485
Who could possibly injure you?

42:49.960 --> 42:51.185
Who?

42:52.260 --> 42:53.660
The one in Wudi City.

42:56.660 --> 42:57.910
Wang Xianzhi.

43:29.890 --> 43:32.610
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.385 --> 43:37.185
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.110 --> 43:42.030
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.110 --> 43:46.910
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.210 --> 43:51.110
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.810 --> 43:55.630
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.635 --> 44:00.390
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.410 --> 44:05.335
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.835 --> 44:08.566
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.590 --> 44:09.830
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.610 --> 44:14.470
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

